---
import Section from '../../layout/Section.astro';
---

<Section contained={false} spacing="none" class="relative py-20 lg:py-28">
        <div class="garna-container">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
                <h2 class="text-4xl font-normal leading-tight text-white lg:text-5xl font-manrope" data-translate="midSizeTestimonials.title">
                    Trusted by Growing Teams
                </h2>
                <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-4xl text-xl font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-400 font-manrope" data-translate="midSizeTestimonials.description">
                    Companies across the SaaS sector, e-commerce, agencies, marketplaces and remote-first businesses put their trust in Garna
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-12 grid gap-8 min-[961px]:grid-cols-3">
                <article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0A0A0A] p-6 text-left">
                    <div class="flex min-h-[4.75rem] items-start gap-4">
                        <div class="h-14 w-14 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full border border-[#5EA500]/30 bg-[#0A0A0A] shadow-[0_0_32px_-16px_rgba(94,165,0,0.9)]">
                            <img src="/pages/payroll-solution-new/assets/07-photo-1487412720507-e7ab37603c6f.jpg" alt="Priya Raman" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                        </div>
                        <div class="min-w-0 pt-1">
                            <h3 class="font-semibold text-white font-manrope">Priya Raman</h3>
                            <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-5 text-gray-500 font-manrope" data-translate="midSizeTestimonials.priya.role">Finance Director, CloudNest</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-7 text-gray-400" data-translate="midSizeTestimonials.priya.quote">
                        "Garna helped us move payroll out of spreadsheets. Employees and contractors now run through one process, and finance has one clear view of costs"
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0A0A0A] p-6 text-left">
                    <div class="flex min-h-[4.75rem] items-start gap-4">
                        <div class="h-14 w-14 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-[#0A0A0A] shadow-[0_0_32px_-16px_rgba(255,255,255,0.55)]">
                            <img src="/pages/payroll-solution-new/assets/03-83a1ae5f-c842-4ee9-a912-505fc66a1ee0_320w.webp" alt="Daniel Kovacs" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                        </div>
                        <div class="min-w-0 pt-1">
                            <h3 class="font-semibold text-white font-manrope">Daniel Kovacs</h3>
                            <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-5 text-gray-500 font-manrope" data-translate="midSizeTestimonials.daniel.role">COO, MarketLoop</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-7 text-gray-400" data-translate="midSizeTestimonials.daniel.quote">
                        "As headcount grew, approvals and contractor invoices became messy fast. Garna gave us a cleaner workflow without adding another layer of manual checks"
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0A0A0A] p-6 text-left">
                    <div class="flex min-h-[4.75rem] items-start gap-4">
                        <div class="h-14 w-14 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full border border-[#5EA500]/30 bg-[#0A0A0A] shadow-[0_0_32px_-16px_rgba(94,165,0,0.7)]">
                            <img src="/pages/payroll-solution-new/assets/08-photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb.jpg" alt="Amina Brooks" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                        </div>
                        <div class="min-w-0 pt-1">
                            <h3 class="font-semibold text-white font-manrope">Amina Brooks</h3>
                            <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-5 text-gray-500 font-manrope" data-translate="midSizeTestimonials.amina.role">People Operations Lead, AtlasWorks</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-7 text-gray-400" data-translate="midSizeTestimonials.amina.quote">
                        "We manage teams across several regions now, and Garna keeps payout timing, documents, and reporting predictable enough for HR and finance to work from the same source"
                    </p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </div>
    </Section>
